{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c55ac7bd-9340-84b4-bcc1-5ffec26f7436",
  "created_at": "2026-01-26T17:55:29-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Samir Kim",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:50:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:50:49-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise. Samir Kim here. I know City Hall's closed, it's almost six, but I saw this number was the storm line, so I figured I'd try it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:51:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got the right place. We're staffed on the storm line tonight. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:51:09-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The plow went through on my street earlier, and it pushed everything up at the bus stop. The stop is buried. There's a bank of snow, heavy stuff too since it turned to rain, and nobody can get to the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:51:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Which street are you on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:51:31-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "326 Dean Avenue. The stop is right out front, more or less, just in front of my house and a little toward the corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:51:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Dean Avenue, Fifth Ward. Got it. And is it the bank along the curb where the bus pulls up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:51:51-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. I walked out there around four. I told my neighbor, I said, that's gonna be a problem for the morning bus. And she said, they'll never clear that by seven. So I said, well, let me call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:52:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Smart. How tall is the pile, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:52:13-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Almost up to my hip. Wet and packed. You'd have to climb over it to get on the bus. People would be stepping out into the road instead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:52:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's not good. So what you're asking for is a plow to come back and open that stop up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:52:35-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Just come back and clear the stop, and a bit of the curb if they can. I'm not asking for the whole street redone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:52:47-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll put it in as a return request for tonight's list. I can't tell you the exact hour. The crews are working through a lot of streets after this one, and the rain made everything heavy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:53:04-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. I talked to a guy at the bus company last week about something else, and he said, the city handles the snow at the stops. So I figured it was you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:53:19-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's us for the plowing, yes. Sometimes if the pile is really big they send a loader or a different truck, so it might not be the same plow that was there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:53:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, whatever works. I just need it cleared."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:53:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me get your name spelled right. Samir, and last name Kim, K-I-M?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:53:45-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:53:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And a callback number in case the crew has a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:53:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0197. It's the landline, so if I'm out, it'll just ring. Leave a message."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:54:00-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-seven. Good. I've got Dean Avenue, 326, bus stop buried by plow bank, request a return pass. Anything else there, like a hydrant or a driveway blocked?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:54:13-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My driveway's got a ridge across the end too, but I'll deal with that. I'm not calling about that. I'm watching the grocery budget pretty closely this month, so I'm not about to pay somebody to do it when I've got a shovel, you know. I'll do the driveway myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:54:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. The driveway ridge is the homeowner's job, but I'll note the stop as the priority."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:54:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And is there a number I should call if it's not done by morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:54:50-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can call back on this same line. After about seven in the morning the regular Public Works office picks up too. Just mention the Dean Avenue request."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:55:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I'll say I talked to Denise, and she said it was logged."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:55:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. Tell them it was logged Monday evening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:55:14-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Monday evening, got it. Well, thank you. I appreciate you picking up this late."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:55:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. Have a good night, Mr. Kim."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:55:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
